    Not compiled: tests of Roslyn APIs that Roslyn 4+ removed and the Ide no longer uses (ADR 0010):
    - MonoDevelop.Ide.RoslynServices/MonoDevelopProjectCacheHostServiceTests.cs: Roslyn's project cache service
