    - MonoDevelop.Ide.RoslynServices/RoslynServiceTests.cs: the foreground thread affinity of Roslyn EditorFeatures
      (IThreadingContext, ForegroundThreadAffinitizedObject), which the C# binding does not use (T089).
    - MonoDevelop.Ide.RoslynServices.Options/*.cs: the Roslyn 3 option storage API (IOptionService,
